{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to the Souper Star Cafe where the secret ingredient is Magic. Help Min and her sous chef Max  cook with their spells to make the best soup possible.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Based Puzzle Matching</strong>, where you'll have to match ingredients in real time! Avoid your ingredients touching the bottom of the pot where they'll end up burning. Too many burned ingredients and your soup will be ruined!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accumulate Curses</strong> over time and survive as long as you can while trying to attain the highest score possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Spells</strong> to either help save your soup or to score even higher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward Gameplay</strong>. Make and store up larger clusters of ingredients or chain combos to score even more, and take extra curse cards for even higher multipliers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3248200?t=1772014792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772014792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248200/3195dd921ea513bb0164378f1022c4ebb7f00499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772014792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248200/3195dd921ea513bb0164378f1022c4ebb7f00499/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772014792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4383100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to the Souper Star Cafe where the secret ingredient is Magic. Help Min and her sous chef Max  cook with their spells to make the best soup possible.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Based Puzzle Matching</strong>, where you'll have to match ingredients in real time! Avoid your ingredients touching the bottom of the pot where they'll end up burning. Too many burned ingredients and your soup will be ruined!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accumulate Curses</strong> over time and survive as long as you can while trying to attain the highest score possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Spells</strong> to either help save your soup or to score even higher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward Gameplay</strong>. Make and store up larger clusters of ingredients or chain combos to score even more, and take extra curse cards for even higher multipliers</p></li></ul>","developers":["Havlark Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248200/header.jpg?t=1772014792","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3248200/1468080616/5283891fe10f5f45b5beda328828fb79bffbba76/1772014063/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772014791","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3248200/1468080616/5283891fe10f5f45b5beda328828fb79bffbba76/1772014063/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772014791","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3248200/1468080616/5283891fe10f5f45b5beda328828fb79bffbba76/1772014063/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772014791","id":257167481,"name":"Witchpop Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167481/9881d3830c4c818130a6eed1f6f70b089e716003/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772014791"}],"name":"Witchpop","pa